{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23673","headline":"答尉迟少监水阁重宴 · 白居易","name":"答尉迟少监水阁重宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人情依旧岁华新，今日重招往日宾。\n鸡黍重回千里驾，林园闇换四年春。\n水轩平写琉璃镜，草岸斜铺翡翠茵。\n闻道经营费心力，忍教成後属他人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23673.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23673","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}